[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://unitvisibilityparent"]

; Moves the `visibility_parent` link. Each sphere names the box below it as its visibility parent,
; and only the boxes set a range. At the framed camera, about 12.0 from the left box and 9.6 from
; the right, the first box is past its begin, so its sphere hides. The second camera is short of
; its begin, so the box hides and the sphere draws. The third sphere fades in across its box's
; DEPENDENCIES begin margin. The fourth sphere takes its parent's link through a Node3D group and
; hides. unit-visibility-range sets ranges on boxes without a visibility parent.

